{
  "category": "Process",
  "notes": [
    "Hand-made, shaped like PerformanceCounterCategory('Process').ReadCategory(), with made-up program names. Counter",
    "types and frequencies are the ones Windows reports. Two readings 5 s apart; % Processor Time is in 100 ns units.",
    "Working Set - Private values are whole MiB: browser#1 to #3 800 + 400 + 200 = 1400 MiB, my#app and my#app#1",
    "150 + 100 = 250 MiB. CPU over the 5 s on 24 cores (T92-05): editor +10 s = 8.3, gameapp +30 s = 25.0,",
    "browser +2 + 1 + 0.5 s = 2.9, my#app +0.6 + 0.6 s = 1.0, vmmemWSL +12 s = 10.0, charlie +1.2 s = 1.0,",
    "delta +2.4 s = 2.0, alpha and echo 0.0. foxtrot restarted (ID Process 6600 then 6601), bravo is new in the",
    "current reading, and gameapp#1 exited after the previous one: those have no CPU number.",
    "_Total and Idle carry ID Process 0, as on Windows, and are never rows."
  ],
